==Battleground==
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.27~1.33 seconds<sup>8f~40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~60 seconds<sup>400f~1,800f</sup>.
*5 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 60~80 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sho Ayanokoji (Enemy)|Sho Ayanokoji]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**6 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**6 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
**10 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. Sho Ayanokoji's pathetic range makes him not an issue. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can easily carry this stage.

